<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Maze Map: Areas, Sewer Route, and Hidden Zones" description="Use a Sell Lemons maze map hub for surface areas, sewer route links, hidden key zones, mobile steps, and embedded video references with evidence labels.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Map Hub</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Maze Map</h1>
          <p>Use this map hub before choosing a hidden route. It separates broad area planning from the sewer-specific lever puzzle so you can open the right guide on mobile.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons maze map hub for hidden routes" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="guide-detail">
      <p class="evidence-note">Evidence boundary: this page uses reported route structures and estimated planning logic. It is not an official full game map and does not verify rewards.</p>

      <h2>What This Maze Map Covers</h2>
      <p>The Sell Lemons Maze Map is a route hub for areas, hidden objectives, and the next page you should open. It covers the surface stand, upgrade planning, sewer entrance, lever rooms, and hidden key routes. Use it when you know the goal but need the correct route page before touching puzzle state.</p>

      <h2>Why Players Need a Map First</h2>
      <div class="info-grid">
        {mapWarnings.map((item) => (
          <section class="guide-step-card">
            <span class="tag">{item.status}</span>
            <h3>{item.title}</h3>
            <p>{item.note}</p>
          </section>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>How to Use This Map on Mobile</h2>
      <ol class="mobile-step-list">
        {mobileSteps.map((step) => <li>{step}</li>)}
      </ol>

      <h2>Map Areas and Next Pages</h2>
      <div class="route-table">
        {areaRows.map((row) => (
          <div>
            <strong>{row.area} <span class="tag">{row.status}</span></strong>
            <span>{row.goal} <a href={row.next}>{row.nextLabel}</a></span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <VideoGuideBlock
        id="maze-map-video-guides"
        title="Video Maze References"
        note="youtube_embed: these videos help players orient visually, but they are not official map, route, reward, or timer proof."
        videos={youtubeEmbeds}
      />

      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {faqItems.map((item) => (
          <details class="faq-card">
            <summary>{item.question}</summary>
            <div class="faq-card__body">
              <p>{item.answer}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2>Next Route Pages</h2>
      <div class="mini-table">
        <a href="/sewer-maze-map/">Open sewer maze map</a>
        <a href="/lever-sequence/">Use lever sequence checklist</a>
        <a href="/sewer-key/">Follow Sewer Key guide</a>
        <a href="/ufo-key/">Follow UFO Key guide</a>
        <a href="/money-fast/">Plan money route</a>
      </div>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="maze-map" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
